{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝陳山聰一向吸金力強、工作不斷。</p><p>日前他在社交網分享工作近照，特別標註圈中金牌司儀Bob（林盛斌），感謝對方再次帶挈他一同出外賺外快。</p><p>陳山聰更展現港式幽默，開玩笑稱：「我相信全港男主持最有自信着衫嗰個一定係你！</p><p>時裝界欠你一個交代！</p><p>」兩人好感</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.238940+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T08:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"60b615874d5604e4a8edc873d8f594266d7f3126f50904d3ab80a198d166148f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}